# L §5.8 example inputs, copied whole (with the indexes and kinds they name).  They load (declaring a dist or
# an observed input is allowed; reading one is writer 2's and 3's).  Nothing reads them: WARN-UNREAD each
# (L §8.5), not compared here.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index age_groups = [u5, u18, u24]
kind persons
input cpi[y in years]: num

input allowances[g in age_groups]: money PLN question "Jaka jest kwota zasiłku dla tej grupy wieku?"
input born[p in persons]: date
input wibor: rate
input day_basis: daycount
input fx[u in currencies]: num PLN/u reading
input growth[y in years]: dist 1/year
input len: calendar
input rent_wish: money PLN prices 2026 by cpi
input bank: observed
=== expect
